  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/8fOUIEikf903nFvKPqCAAUnauAGixpcpr_gpoIF2948.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/>\nInitially without water, $\\frac{1}{36}-\\frac{1}{-45}=\\frac{1}{f} \\Rightarrow f=20$\nthen, after pouring water upto 40 cm<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/CfU4Lva3ezYHJaVmlMgFgfQlKTHUUCYtmBPl8-iYOvo.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/>\napparent object distance $=\\frac{40}{\\mu}+5, \\frac{1}{48}+\\frac{1}{\\frac{40}{\\mu}+5}=\\frac{1}{20} \\Rightarrow \\mu=1.366$",
    "image": null
  },
